Homepage: https://github.com/ajaxiis-rust/xneur-xtest-fix
Description: automatic keyboard layout switcher (xneur 0.21.0, XTEST fixes)
 Patched build of xneur/gxneur 0.21.0 from the xneur-devel fork. It brings
 back automatic EN<->RU layout correction on modern X11 desktops.
 .
 Three fixes over upstream: the corrected word is typed with
 XTestFakeKeyEvent instead of XSendEvent (xterm and VTE accept it), the word
 is deleted together with the delimiter that was already delivered and the
 delimiter is re-sent afterwards, and the XI2 echo of the program's own
 injection is filtered out so it no longer corrects itself.
 .
 Tested on Ubuntu 22.04.5 LTS with XFCE 4.16 and an X11 session:
 "ghbdtn " becomes "привет " and "руддщ " becomes "hello " in zenity, xterm
 and xfce4-terminal.
